e":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-07-09T17:34:53-07:00","id":1552246,"title":"","content":"DNA is probably ahead of them. After all, CGA is missing Thymine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude02","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-07-09T20:22:09-07:00","id":1552250,"title":"","content":"Never saw anything linking them, and don't think there should be.<br /> <br /> Given their shady business and differences in goals, it's unlikely that they know about each other, that they'll come in contact, or that they'll work together for any reason if they do.<br /> <br /> While their overall behavior is similar, their reasons and preferences aren't just background, they're important. As a &quot;Monster of the Week&quot; there will hardly be any difference in employing one or the other, but as a chronicle's fixture the differences will affect a lot of how the PCs can deal with each.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}